{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cda472a1e285402b0b30246cc96bb31700af1cbb4b041d6c3caf70f837563925", "ja": "（瑞希と美奈子の、PV撮影が進んでいる。\n瑞希は求められた役を、見事に演じきってくれた！）", "zh": "（瑞希和美奈子的PV拍摄正在顺利进行。\n瑞希出色地完成了要求她饰演的角色！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1001_p", "source_sha256": "617632da44d4f0775f8401bf53cbd0ee427f0b2baef791dc84a09abfaefbce96", "ja": "お疲れさま、瑞希！\nいい感じだったじゃないか。", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希！  \n演得相当不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "da6572c367645e7ac09e40cce1aeeb15c08003327bd3d3561eeb1a514e5e35f2", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n見てくれていましたか……私の演技。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n您一直在看吗……我的演技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7d2f95ba68927900b987bc601cb7b8fbebc1a8b323c80b4288d1dcd79b8dd797", "ja": "もちろん。あの袖を引く演技なんて特によかったよ。\nきっと、誰もがグッとくるだろうな。", "zh": "当然。尤其是拉住袖子的那段演技，真的很棒。大家肯定都会被打动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "feca196234c8cd99de8b15ea61fc7d54ef72b3e6378696f9b8ac3a75561da97b", "ja": "さすが{$P$}。\nあれこそ、佐竹さんとの練習の成果なのです。", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}。\n那正是和佐竹小姐一起练习的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2e1d07046287053a7f5ece3ff221d326eb0d28b6b1a4c9bf9520bb4d2a71cdf2", "ja": "練習……このPV撮影のためにふたりでやってた、\n疑似恋愛体験のことだよな？", "zh": "练习……是指为了拍这个PV，我们两个人做的模拟恋爱体验吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "f8188a0cb3970851848cdb0bf32fe1555e2897177fc8d1b1bdb26f89c562a6e0", "ja": "はい。あるとき、佐竹さんが忘れ物をしたため、\n袖をクイッとやって引き止めたのですが……。", "zh": "是的。有一次，佐竹小姐忘了东西，我便轻轻拽住她的袖子，想把她留下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "60abb36431b0645481d4b8e86746b78d9aa205447d558aa47aa5698c4eb19c60", "ja": "「すごくキュンときた！」と絶賛されて、\n恋人ごっこを一日延長したほどでした。", "zh": "她赞不绝口地表示“这也太让人心动了！”，\n甚至让情侣过家家游戏延长了一整天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "8b217b5d2becb3f0f6171e5b8795a125c5f20c53cb2e9dac08e0713539edd06c", "ja": "あの『袖クイ』は、そんな研究の末に編み出された\n奥義なのです。……恋愛の真髄、見つけたり。", "zh": "那个“拉衣袖”，就是经过那番研究后创造出来的\n奥义。……恋爱的精髓，找到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1009_p", "source_sha256": "68380ec5cef4291a99d682db98b1383294577e9e6b3df03437919cb1c23ba202", "ja": "奥義……なるほど。なりきり体験をした甲斐が\nあったな！　恋の切なさも、表現できてたし。", "zh": "奥义……原来如此。那这趟角色扮演体验总算没白费！\n恋爱的揪心之处，也好好表现出来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "125dd3d003d8df2e54f2ebe3f5d100d9b55c240748c685ae9bfa0bb534635b33", "ja": "切なさ……はい。それに関しては、\n{$P$}のことも考えていたので。", "zh": "那份苦涩……是的。关于这一点，我也想到了\n{$P$}的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "b0f5c378fac294b3c4c86bca9a7b077a3df95fd64c2ec33b1c41b955724430e5", "ja": "もし、{$P$}に見捨てられたらという\n想像を……おっと、泣きそうです。ぐすっ。", "zh": "要是被{$P$}抛弃了会怎么样，\n光是想想……哎呀，快要哭出来了。抽泣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1012_p", "source_sha256": "228242b5a03cbaf61698955561b3becfbb7c07692d9d175abdbedd289d0e5a41", "ja": "えっ、そんな急に……想像しただけで！？", "zh": "诶，这么突然……光是想象一下就……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "3ec572af7c5fdf5458e4f9a0af47220f120c00982108f0bb31c4eeeb16e018b6", "ja": "耐えるぞ、瑞希。耐えるんだ……。\n……大丈夫、落ち着きました。", "zh": "忍住，瑞希。要忍住……。\n……没事，冷静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8c068ae009eb1258941f77c02cce72d162619fd8150f6be7c302d90bd6fe988a", "ja": "よかった……凄い想像力だな。\n俺が瑞希を見捨てるなんて、ありえないのに。", "zh": "太好了……你这想象力真丰富啊。\n我怎么可能会抛下瑞希不管呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b9dabc62328cdbc7c11cb671ca6541a2e49f2db22c65bbe4fef5a910d75c7c46", "ja": "むしろ俺の方こそ、見捨てられないように、\nちゃんと仕事をしなきゃと思うくらいだ。", "zh": "倒不如说，我才更应该好好工作，免得被抛弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "ffaa6a4d4e7150e6a713d6250d53228ffc2c4abadd80a18f597084c3f45714c9", "ja": "私が{$P$}を……？\nそれこそありえません……断言するぞ。", "zh": "我会抛弃{$P$}……？\n那根本不可能……我可以断言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1017_p", "source_sha256": "dd0edb85f941751c30c5a3563c6e2e63fa310eb8c593124a10bec0fc7a223b56", "ja": "本当か？　……じゃあ万が一、瑞希に見捨てられた\n時のために『袖クイ』を教えてもらおうかな。", "zh": "真的吗？……那我还是先让瑞希教我“拉袖子”吧，以防万一被她抛弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "aa5f5410e188ed0e6773ef4b4df2a395854cc2cd7d07454f0ecd553b68b7eec0", "ja": "{$P$}が、『袖クイ』を？\nそれは……ダメです。", "zh": "{$P$}要学『拽袖子』？\n那个……不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e6bfa76b7754094d1d837ae86b384accd57fc1c1718e80d79b21c8b296bbd9cd", "ja": "えっ、ダメ？　そ、そうか。", "zh": "诶，不行吗？这、这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "f5a874aca4edeab1403554352a9dddaf0d5d032ed917dd30f930cd96bd3b390d", "ja": "破壊力が、高すぎますから。想像しただけで……。\nいや、しかし……やってもらいたい気も。", "zh": "因为破坏力太强了。光是想象一下……。\n不，但是……又有点想让你做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "e98c9790a62a90de74d74771a1c49213277eeb451cb1e78a2595ff372c4785e3", "ja": "……。わかりました。\n奥義『袖クイ』を伝授しましょう。", "zh": "……。我明白了。\n就传授给您奥义“扯衣袖”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ea2d04e61c6a3a17c71d3dc876eafb31ada488f329f2bb68fd424715195cd4dd", "ja": "えっ、あ、うん……いいのか。", "zh": "诶？啊，嗯……真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0224_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "feccef7cc84ba71b4760e9b08743349ffd34d7c7420d4ef46fed03ac876bdb93", "ja": "しかし、奥義ですので、一朝一夕には習得できません。\n私と特訓してもらいます……よし、役得だぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "不过，这是奥义，不是一朝一夕就能学会的。\n请和我一起特训……好，这可是额外的福利，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
